		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4500&amp;p=33560#p33560"><![CDATA[
A new GD77/RD5R/DM1801 Beta is available<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/7bf8c452d1cc4add31cf82d74765e0f319b7bc32/" class="postlink">downloads/GD77/Firmware/7bf8c452d1cc4ad ... 319b7bc32/</a><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest</a><br><br>Changes in this version<br><br>* On the Channel Details screen, the repeater Latitude and Longitude can be entered and also the "Use location" setting, can be set to Yes/No.<br>Note. the Use location is called "Location" because "Use location" won't fit on the screen<br>* Prevent Roaming channels re-sorting when a scan is ended.<br>* Updates to the Italian language translation<br><br>Thanks to Daniel F1RMB for his work on these changes and enhancements, and to IZ2EIB  for the Italian language translation<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Fri Oct 18, 2024 9:16 am</p><hr />
